injective_intro
---------------
l1: $ … ⇒ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F → x = y $ by imp_intro [#1]
l2: $ … ⇒ ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F → ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F → x = y $ by imp_intro [l1]
l3: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F $ by ax
l4: $ … ⇒ ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F $ by and_elim_l [l3]
l5: $ … ⇒ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F $ by and_elim_r [l3]
l6: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F → ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F → x = y $ by weaken [l2]
l7: $ … ⇒ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F → x = y $ by imp_elim [l6, l4]
l8: $ … ⇒ x = y $ by imp_elim [l7, l5]
l9: $ … ⇒ ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F → x = y $ by imp_intro [l8]
l10: $ … ⇒ ∀ z (⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F → x = y) $ by all_intro [l9]
l11: $ … ⇒ ∀ y ∀ z (⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F → x = y) $ by all_intro [l10]
l12: $ … ⇒ ∀ x ∀ y ∀ z (⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F → x = y) $ by all_intro [l11]

injective_elim
--------------
l1: $ … ⇒ ∀ y ∀ z (⟨ a , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F → a = y) $ by all_elim [#1]
l2: $ … ⇒ ∀ z (⟨ a , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ b , z ⟩ ∈ F → a = b) $ by all_elim [l1]
l3: $ … ⇒ ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ b , c ⟩ ∈ F → a = b $ by all_elim [l2]
l4: $ … ⇒ ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ b , c ⟩ ∈ F $ by and_intro [#2, #3]
l5: $ … ⇒ a = b $ by imp_elim [l3, l4]

injective_subset
----------------
l1: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F , ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F $ by ax
l2: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F , ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F $ by ax
