l5: $ … ⇒ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ H $ by wcel_subset [l3, l2]
l6: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F , ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ injective H $ by weaken [#1]
l7: $ … ⇒ x = y $ by injective_elim [l6, l4, l5]
l8: $ … ⇒ injective F $ by injective_intro [l7]

