l6: $ (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ F → u = v) ⟺ (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ H ∧ ⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ H → u = v) $ by im_congr [l4, l5]
l7: $ ∀ w (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ F → u = v) ⟺ ∀ w (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ H ∧ ⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ H → u = v) $ by all_congr [l6]
l8: $ ∀ v ∀ w (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ F → u = v) ⟺ ∀ v ∀ w (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ H ∧ ⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ H → u = v) $ by all_congr [l7]
l9: $ ∀ u ∀ v ∀ w (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ F → u = v) ⟺ ∀ u ∀ v ∀ w (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ H ∧ ⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ H → u = v) $ by all_congr [l8]

