a6: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom H F , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ ccom H F , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ F , ⟨ u , y ⟩ ∈ H , ⟨ x , v ⟩ ∈ F , ⟨ v , z ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ functional H $ by weaken [l4]
