g1: $ G , u ∊ hartogs s , v = reps u s ⇒ v = reps u s $ by ax
g2: $ G , u ∊ hartogs s , v = reps u s ⇒ ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) $ by cgr_intro [g1]
g3: $ G , u ∊ hartogs s , v = reps u s ⇒ u ∊ hartogs s $ by ax
g4: $ … ⇒ ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s $ by cres_intro [g3, g2]
