h1: $ G , ⟨ i , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s ⇒ ⟨ i , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s $ by ax
h2: $ … ⇒ i ∊ hartogs s ∧ ⟨ i , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) $ by cres_elim [h1]
h3: $ … ⇒ i ∊ hartogs s $ by and_elim_l [h2]
h4: $ … ⇒ ⟨ i , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) $ by and_elim_r [h2]
h5: $ … ⇒ k = reps i s $ by cgr_elim [h4]
h6: $ G , ⟨ i , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s ⇒ ⟨ j , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s $ by ax
h7: $ … ⇒ j ∊ hartogs s ∧ ⟨ j , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) $ by cres_elim [h6]
h8: $ … ⇒ j ∊ hartogs s $ by and_elim_l [h7]
h9a: $ … ⇒ ⟨ j , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) $ by and_elim_r [h7]
h9: $ … ⇒ k = reps j s $ by cgr_elim [h9a]
h10: $ … ⇒ ord i ∧ inj_into i s $ by hartogs_elim [h3]
h10a: $ … ⇒ ord i $ by and_elim_l [h10]
h10b: $ … ⇒ inj_into i s $ by and_elim_r [h10]
h11: $ … ⇒ ord j ∧ inj_into j s $ by hartogs_elim [h8]
h11a: $ … ⇒ ord j $ by and_elim_l [h11]
h12: $ … ⇒ ∃ w (w ∊ reps i s) $ by reps_nonempty [h10b]
w1: $ G , ⟨ i , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s , w ∊ reps i s ⇒ w ∊ reps i s $ by ax
w2a: $ G , ⟨ i , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s , w ∊ reps i s ⇒ k = reps i s $ by weaken [h5]
w2: $ … ⇒ reps i s = k $ by eq_sym [w2a]
w3: $ … ⇒ w ∊ k $ by welc_eq [w2, w1]
w4a: $ G , ⟨ i , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s , w ∊ reps i s ⇒ k = reps j s $ by weaken [h9]
w4: $ … ⇒ w ∊ reps j s $ by welc_eq [w4a, w3]
w5a: $ G , ⟨ i , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s , w ∊ reps i s ⇒ ord i $ by weaken [h10a]
w5b: $ G , ⟨ i , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ∈ cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s , w ∊ reps i s ⇒ ord j $ by weaken [h11a]
w5: $ … ⇒ i = j $ by reps_disjoint [w5a, w5b, w1, w4]
h13: $ … ⇒ i = j $ by ex_elim [h12, w5]
h14: $ … ⇒ injective (cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s) $ by injective_intro [h13]
h15: $ … ⇒ injective (cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s ↾ hartogs s) $ by injective_cres [h14]
l1: $ … ⇒ injects (cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s) (hartogs s) (𝒫 (𝒫 s × 𝒫 (s × s))) $ by injects_intro [f5, h15]

