d12: $ G , c = cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s , u = hartogs s , v = 𝒫 (𝒫 s × 𝒫 (s × s)) , v ∊ U ⇒ universe U $ by weaken [#1]
d13: $ G , c = cgr x (reps x s) ↾ hartogs s , u = hartogs s , v = 𝒫 (𝒫 s × 𝒫 (s × s)) , v ∊ U ⇒ v ∊ U $ by ax
